   {
    "id": "p_00033",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     61,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The following new requirements on POSIX implementations derive from alignment with the Single UNIX Specification:",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00034",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     61,
     3,
     1,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The DESCRIPTION is updated to indicate that interactions with the [I60]setitimer[/I60](), [I61]ualarm[/I61](), and [I62]usleep[/I62]()\nfunctions are unspecified.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I60": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I61": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I62": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00035",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     61,
     5
    ],
    "text": "IEEE&nbsp;Std&nbsp;1003.1-2001/Cor&nbsp;2-2004, item XSH/TC2/D6/16 is applied, replacing &quot;an implementation-defined maximum\nvalue&quot; with &quot;an implementation-specific maximum value&quot; in the RATIONALE.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00036",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
